\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview of a barge-in episode in VerbalVis. While the assistant is explaining a visualization, the user interrupts to redirect the exploratory analysis from sales by state to sales by product category. VerbalVis immediately cancels obsolete speech, replans visualization actions through tool execution, reinjects the updated dashboard state as contextual grounding for the language model, and synchronously updates both the dashboard and spoken response. The aligned voice, tool, and dashboard timelines illustrate the coordinated full-duplex interaction that enables continuous analytical intent evolution without explicit turn switching.}}{1}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:teaser}{{1}{1}{Overview of a barge-in episode in VerbalVis. While the assistant is explaining a visualization, the user interrupts to redirect the exploratory analysis from sales by state to sales by product category. VerbalVis immediately cancels obsolete speech, replans visualization actions through tool execution, reinjects the updated dashboard state as contextual grounding for the language model, and synchronously updates both the dashboard and spoken response. The aligned voice, tool, and dashboard timelines illustrate the coordinated full-duplex interaction that enables continuous analytical intent evolution without explicit turn switching}{figure.1}{}}
